wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T15:28:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T15:28:39Z","body":"> @MXKhronos Have you tested if this PR helps to fix the issue for you?\r\n\r\nSorry, I'm new to this. How do I generate cpp bindings from my custom godot build to test it? I've tried adding `generate_bindings=yes` to the `scons` args and it didn't seem to generate anything new when I compile.\r\n\r\nI ran `scons target=editor generate_bindings=yes`\r\n\r\n ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954137106/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954155002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98929#issuecomment-2954155002","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98929","id":2954155002,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wFNP6","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T16:07:22Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T16:07:22Z","body":"You need to first build Godot with this PR, and then you can run `godot --dump-extension-api` which will make a new `extension_api.json`. Then when building your GDExtension, you can either replace the existing `extension_api.json`, or just point to it (with godot-cpp and scons, that's `scons custom_api_file=path/to/extension_api.json`). That should make the new `EditorSyntaxHighlighter::_create()` virtual method available to your extension","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954155002/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954322570","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98929#issuecomment-2954322570","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98929","id":2954322570,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wF2KK","user":{"login":"MXKhronos","id":38783502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NzgzNTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38783502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos","html_url":"https://github.com/MXKhronos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MXKhronos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T23:12:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T23:12:13Z","body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nIt compile, runs and seems fix, that's all my extension does atm.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nRef<EditorSyntaxHighlighter> EditorSyntaxHighlighter::_create() const {\r\n\tRef<EditorSyntaxHighlighter> syntax_highlighter;\r\n\tif (GDVIRTUAL_IS_OVERRIDDEN(_create)) {\r\n\t\tprint_verbose(\"Using overridden syntax highlighter\");\r\n\t\tGDVIRTUAL_CALL(_create, syntax_highlighter);\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tprint_verbose(\"Using default syntax highlighter\");\r\n\t\tsyntax_highlighter.instantiate();\r\n\t\tif (get_script_instance()) {\r\n\t\t\tsyntax_highlighter->set_script(get_script_instance()->get_script());\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\treturn syntax_highlighter;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8ef33dc-17f6-4d39-a402-2f7fdacd3a08)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2954322570/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2955619704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98929#issuecomment-2955619704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98929","id":